#N canvas 120 60 900 640 12;
#X text 20 10 fs_pluck_voice <root_midi> - the pluck sound with plain inputs. Inlet 1 (cold): pitch 0..1 (quantized to a scale over 2 octaves from root) or "scale ..." messages. Inlet 2 (hot): velocity 0..1 - plays the current note. Three harmonics \, 700 ms decay \, monophonic. Wrappers (fs_pluck \, fs_pluck_point) decide which motion drives which input., f 110;
#X obj 20 120 inlet;
#X obj 20 150 fs_quantize \$1 2;
#X obj 280 230 f;
#X obj 280 120 inlet;
#X obj 280 150 clip 0 1;
#X obj 280 190 t f b;
#X obj 280 260 mtof;
#X obj 280 290 t f f f;
#X obj 280 340 osc~;
#X obj 380 320 * 2;
#X obj 380 350 osc~;
#X obj 480 320 * 3;
#X obj 480 350 osc~;
#X obj 380 380 *~ 0.4;
#X obj 480 380 *~ 0.15;
#X obj 280 420 +~;
#X obj 280 450 +~;
#X msg 600 230 \$1 3 \, 0 700 3;
#X obj 600 270 vline~;
#X obj 600 310 *~;
#X obj 280 510 *~;
#X obj 280 550 *~ 0.3;
#X obj 280 590 outlet~;
#X text 20 95 pitch 0..1 / scale, f 18;
#X text 280 95 velocity 0..1 (plays), f 22;
